dialogue greenvalley_road_merchant
title: A lantern on the road
trigger: StageCleared greenvalley-01
speaker merchant - name='Lantern Merchant' portrait=courier
speaker commander $commander

node hail merchant
  A white wagon with no white collectors on it. Now there's something you don't see.
  -> reply

node reply commander
  We're not Choir. Are you going to tell anyone?
  -> ask

node ask merchant
  Not if you let me ride along. I've got lanterns, oil, and a very good map for twenty gold.
  * Come with us. -> joined
    do: JoinNpc merchant
  * We'll buy the map. -> map
    if: GoldAtLeast 20
    do: GrantGold -20
    do: SetFlag bought_map
  * We don't need you. -> snubbed
    do: SetFlag merchant_snubbed

node map merchant
  Sold. And a potion for good faith. Now, about that ride?
  do: GrantItem healing_potion_basic 1
  * Come along. -> joined
    do: JoinNpc merchant
  * We're fine. -> snubbed
    do: SetFlag merchant_snubbed

node snubbed merchant
  Rude. I'm coming anyway. You'll need me.
  do: JoinNpc merchant

node joined merchant
  Splendid. I'll set up shop in the back.
